<title>USA: TABLE - A.D. Tech Q2 net decreases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - A.D. Tech Q2 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>TAUNTON, Mass. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	     Six Months Ended</p>
<p>		     June 30   June 30	   June 30    June 30</p>
<p>			1997	1996		1997	  1996</p>
<p>Revenues	   $3,546    $2,634	    $6,672	$4,948</p>
<p>Net Income	    287	 537		 517	   343</p>
